For TFPT research read `AGENTS.md` and pick the mode first.

- Exploration (new ideas, Neuansatz, complete solution): read
  `docs/research/TFPT-STAND.md`, follow `docs/research/EXPLORATION.md`; Atlas
  and `docs/catalog/` for details; no PLAN/RESULTS/progress or contract chains
  first.
- Continuation (continue the plan or a named task): top of
  `docs/research/fundamental-plan/PLAN.md`, compact `progress.json`, newest
  `RESULTS.md`, then the live Atlas.

A past "Nächster Schritt" is never an obligation. R113 and the other original
source contracts are scoped tests of their route, not gates for a new principle or
for F1 (user decision of 2026-11-23, see `AGENTS.md`); never cite missing R113
values as the reason another candidate stays open. Record results with source,
scope and verdict; preserve scoped negatives without treating them as a ban on
ideas with different premises.
